{#
    The signature on the emails that speak as "me" (EmailService::ENQUIRY_SIGNATURE,
    exactly as confirmed 13 October 2026). By the voice rules (15 October 2026)
    every customer email that's personal or part of an order's journey is signed:
    the order confirmation (01), the request email (02), the commission email (03),
    emails 04–06, the enquiry email, every quote, every balance request and the
    receipt. Straight after the opening (and any personal note), before the
    numbered sections. Needs the layout's body style.
#}
<div data-email-signature>
{% for paragraph in constant('App\\Service\\EmailService::ENQUIRY_SIGNATURE')|split("\n\n") %}
<p style="{{ body }}">{{ paragraph|nl2br }}</p>
{% endfor %}
</div>
